ind":"update","title":"Demo update: new graphics menu & quality of life","summary":"Thanks to everyone playing the demo during Next Fest! Your feedback went straight into the game.New graphics menuBorderless, fullscreen or windowed, plus your native resolution. Ultrawide monitors now work.Graphics quality Low, Medium, High and UltraRender resolution for weaker GPUs or 4K, the UI stays sharpFPS limit (60 by default) and VSyncThe game remembers your window sizeQuality of lifeCampaign, goals and contracts can each be collapsedClicking the wood price shows what makes up the selling","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:36:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039343","verified_at":"2026-10-24T13:34:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1846651706691510","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest is live: Try the Timberline Factory demo","summary":"Hi everyone,Steam Next Fest runs from October 19 to 26, and the Timberline Factory demo is free to play on Steam during that time. If you ever wanted to run your own sawmill, now is a good moment to give it a try.A quick word about me: I work in a real, large sawmill. That is where the idea for the game came from, and it is also where the realism comes from. A lot of what you see in the game is what I see at work every day.In the demo you build your first production lines, sort logs into boxes a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:02:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691510","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1846651706674789","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"update","title":"Small Update: Finale & New Challenges","summary":"Thanks for keeping at it!NewCampaign finale: one large order to close it all outHardwood and veneer now also appear as goals, contracts, and with shifting market pricesNew worker: the storekeeper, who stores debarked logs automaticallySix new challenges for a new gameFixedCut-wood and sawdust sales count correctlyGoals stay achievable late in the gameMinor display fixesGood luck at the mill!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:04:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674789","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1846018067939140","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"update","title":"Update: Premium Timber","summary":"**Premium timber — hardwood, veneer and a new chapter**Build-ID 25870081 | Demo Build-ID 25870121Thanks for keeping at it. This update brings a new production chain for premium timber to the mill.**New in the full game**- Hardwood sorting line: research it first, then buy it in the buildings shop.- Hardwood sawmill and veneer plant with their own products, prices and machine upgrades.- New campaign chapter “Premium timber” with new goals, contracts and events.**Demo**- The new buildings and rese","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T18:39:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939140","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1846018067926577","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Life in the Yard","summary":"Thanks for keeping at it! This update brings more life to the mill.Log trucks now drive into the yard to drop off and pick up logs.Once the debarker is built, a second truck picks up debarked logs.The full game adds a new plot of land to expand onto.Small improvements to the research window and the mill walkthrough.Good luck at the mill!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T15:34:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926577","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1845383656390591","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: New Camera & Crew Upgrades (Build-ID 25706139)","summary":"`(Build-ID 25706139)`Camera and crewThanks for keeping at it! This update adds a new camera and crew upgrades.CameraNew classic camera like in building games: WASD moves across the yard, mouse wheel or R/F change the height, right mouse button looks around.Press \\ or use the new button on the bar to switch to the previous free camera.CrewNew research \"Workplace safety\": the repairman, cleaning staff and wood seller can be upgraded to Lv. 2 and 3, with shorter sick leave and faster work.Power pla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T06:19:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390591","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1845383656385556","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch: An easier start (Build-ID 25672566)","summary":"(Build-ID 25672566)Thanks for playing, and for the first round of feedback. This update removes a few early traps so the sawmill can get running sooner.**The mill** Machine parts break less often. In the demo there is also more time between two breakdowns. Titanium conveyor upgrades unlock after the debarker. The upgrade button stays visible and shows when. Fast conveyors and the tapered roller conveyor can be bought from day 15. The cheaper standard conveyors are available from the start.**Cont","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T09:16:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385556","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1845383656380054","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"announcement","title":"The Free Demo Is Live!","summary":"Hey everyone! The free Timberline Factory demo is now live on Steam. Saw your first logs, build conveyor lines, keep your machines running and ship your first timber order. And yes, the physics will sometimes fight back :D Early Access launches on Friday, November 6th, and you'll also find the demo at Steam Next Fest from October 19th. Feedback and bug reports are very welcome in the pinned thread in the discussions. I read everything personally! Have fun sawing! Armin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T06:47:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380054","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1844751498222308","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"announcement","title":"Timberline Factory: Free Public Demo Launching October 1st! (What to Expect)","summary":"Hello everyone!The wait is almost over. On Thursday, October 1st, the very first public Steam Demo of Timberline Factory will officially go live!As a solo developer, my goal with this project is to capture the true, gritty atmosphere of a real-world industrial sawmill. This demo is your first ticket to the yard.. a fully packed, 45-to-60-minute experience where you will build your very first functional production lines from scratch.Here is a complete breakdown of what you will experience next we","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T18:01:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1844115010490924","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"announcement","title":"Road to Steam Next Fest: Demo Date, Glulam Plant & Valve Submission!","summary":"Hello everyone!Since our big visual overhaul back in August, the sawmill hasn't stopped buzzing. As a solo developer, I’ve been working day and night to turn your direct feedback into concrete gameplay features. Today, I have huge news: The final Demo build has officially been submitted to Valve for review!Make sure to mark your calendars for October 1st. That’s the day the free Timberline Factory Demo goes live for everyone. This will be our official dress rehearsal for the Steam Next Fest star","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T05:46:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010490924","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1841579228662035","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"update","title":"Update 2.1: The \"Industrial Modern\" Overhaul & Maintenance Mechanics!","summary":"A Fresh Look and Deeper Mechanics Hello everyone! I’ve spent the last week listening closely to your feedback. As a solo developer, your input is vital to making Timberline Factory the ultimate sawmill simulation. Today, I’m excited to present the biggest update to date for both visuals and gameplay.from old:to NEW:🌑 The New \"Industrial Modern\" HUD The old design is history. I have redesigned every single UI element from the ground up. The new HUD is sleeker, more modern, and provides a much cle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T09:37:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1840310314352352","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"update","title":"MAJOR UPDATE: Graphics Overhaul, Real Machine Sounds & Biomass Energy!","summary":"Hello everyone!First of all, thank you for the incredible support during the first few days of the Steam page launch. I've been reading all your comments on Reddit and IndieDB, and I decided to put in some extra shifts to address your feedback immediately.Here is what’s new in the latest version of Timberline Factory:🌲 Enhanced Visuals & Realistic Logs I have completely overhauled the log models. They are now much rounder and more realistic. I’ve also done a major lighting pass to get rid of the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T19:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352352","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1840310314347368","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"update","title":"Screenshot Saturday: Progress Update","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T12:37:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347368","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037170-1840310314341373","game_id":"steam-5037170","kind":"announcement","title":"Timberline Factory is officially announced!","summary":"Welcome to Timberline Factory!Hello everyone! I am incredibly excited to finally announce my project: Timberlin